{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe is in ruins. A pirate empire from another dimension has decimated every planet in the constellation, leaving only Netunia X12. Under attack, General Fluffy sees his defenses annihilated, and the last hope rests with the legendary Captain Puff MacFly, leader of the stellar fleet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957430/extras/273ed572aa00d9269ae3c57a59972767.poster.avif?t=1766501427\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957430/extras/273ed572aa00d9269ae3c57a59972767.webm?t=1766501427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957430/extras/273ed572aa00d9269ae3c57a59972767.mp4?t=1766501427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various items to buy in the death shop (when you die, of course)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 5 challenging stages and a surprise at the end... oops, almost spilled it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics reminiscent of the golden era of video games and CRT TVs, but with a modern twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs on your PC... guaranteed!!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957430/extras/c60b1143e24518926e86dc15a60bdd21.poster.avif?t=1766501427\" width=220 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/39574